The Project Planning phase outlines the roadmap for developing “ToyCraft Tales: Tableau's Vision into Toy Manufacturer Data.”

In this phase, we define the project timeline, task allocation, required tools (SQL, Database, Tableau), and development milestones.

It includes planning for data collection, database creation, data preparation, visualization design, and dashboard development.

This phase ensures smooth execution, proper resource management, and timely completion of the project.
